---
import TemplateLayout from '../layouts/TemplateLayout.astro';
import FounderFilm from '../components/FounderFilm.astro';
---

<TemplateLayout
  title="Jai Bhagat | The person building Dharmic Data"
  description="Jai Bhagat won an NVIDIA hackathon with friends. Now he is building a school where people turn imagination into applications."
  active="about"
>
  <section class="about-template-hero" aria-labelledby="about-title">
    <div class="about-template-copy">
      <p class="subtitle">Jai Bhagat / The person making this bet</p>
      <h1 id="about-title">
        <span>I won an</span>{" "}
        <span class="sticker green">NVIDIA</span>{" "}
        <span>hackathon</span>{" "}
        <span class="sticker coral">with friends.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="about-template-lead">
        Now I'm building a school where people turn imagination into applications.
        I like being at the whiteboard, imagining with someone. Teaching is how
        I make room for others to do that too.
      </p>
      <div class="about-template-actions">
        <a href="/learn" class="primary-button about-primary">Learn with me</a>
        <a href="#story" class="about-text-link">How I got here</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="about-character-stage" aria-hidden="true">
      <div
        class="about-character-rive"
        data-rive-url="/assets/cdn/69577d21-6995b79cfaa7bf474085d59c_home_page_character_1-1-.riv"
        data-rive-state-machine="State Machine 1"
        data-rive-artboard="Artboard"
        data-rive-autoplay="true"
        data-rive-fit="cover"
        data-rive-alignment="center"
        data-animation-type="rive"
      ><canvas></canvas></div>
      <span class="about-note note-top">Start with the person</span>
      <span class="about-note note-bottom">Imagine together</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-proof-rail" aria-label="The work behind the school">
    <div class="proof-pill pink"><strong>NVIDIA</strong><span>A hackathon win with friends</span></div>
    <div class="proof-pill blue"><strong>Since 2022</strong><span>Teaching and mentoring</span></div>
    <div class="proof-pill orange"><strong>MacBooks + GB10</strong><span>Tools to build and learn with</span></div>
    <div class="proof-pill green"><strong>Conscious Compute</strong><span>Teaching what I'm building</span></div>
  </section>

  <section id="story" class="about-story" aria-labelledby="story-title">
    <div class="about-story-heading">
      <p class="subtitle white">Care came before the hardware</p>
      <h2 id="story-title">A call from your<br /><span class="sticker yellow">future self.</span></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="about-story-copy">
      <p class="story-big">
        Our hackathon idea was a supportive call from your future self.
        I teamed up with former Cityblock coworkers in New York. We called
        ourselves American Exceptionalism.
      </p>
      <p>
        NVIDIA, MongoDB and Dell hosted the event. The Dell Pro Max with GB10
        we won expanded what I could build with my MacBooks. Care and teaching
        were already part of my life. The prize gave me more means to continue.
      </p>
      <p>
        In 2022, I started my business with a virtual conference and mentoring.
        Lectures and community workshops followed. In 2025, trying to build
        an AI business exposed gaps in my understanding of inference infrastructure.
        Coding agents helped me build again. I began teaching live workshops
        around what I was learning.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-photo-stack" aria-label="Jai in conversation and teaching">
      <img class="photo-main" src="/dharmic-assets/jai-studio.jpg" alt="Jai speaking about making a useful project with AI" loading="lazy" />
      <img class="photo-card" src="/dharmic-assets/jai-dogged-pursuits.jpg" alt="Jai's Dogged Pursuits conversation and teaching photographs" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <FounderFilm />

  <section class="about-final" aria-labelledby="school-title">
    <div class="about-final-copy">
      <p class="subtitle">A school imagined with others</p>
      <h2 id="school-title">A future we have<br />a <span class="sticker yellow">stake in.</span></h2>
      <p>
        I'm a first-generation American born in the Bronx, with Gujarati and
        Dharmic roots. My traditions and chosen teachers inform how I approach
        the work. You do not need to share my beliefs to belong here.
      </p>
      <p>
        Dharmic Data is the emerging school. Conscious Compute is its signature
        workshop series. My bet is to pay a generation to become builders,
        owners and stewards of their communities' AI future, with protected
        learning time and deep human mentorship.
      </p>
      <p>
        A good teacher can change the course of someone's life. A great teacher
        can change the course of an entire civilization. That is the belief
        I want to put into practice.
      </p>
      <div class="about-template-actions">
        <a href="/school" class="primary-button about-primary">Explore the school</a>
        <a href="/vlog" class="about-text-link">Read the build stories</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div
      class="footer-rive desk"
      data-rive-url="/assets/cdn/69577d21-6995b79cb5c877d98300cec7_footer-bowl-character-animation-3.riv"
      data-rive-state-machine="State Machine 1"
      data-rive-artboard="Artboard"
      data-rive-autoplay="true"
      data-rive-fit="contain"
      data-rive-alignment="center"
      data-animation-type="rive"
      aria-hidden="true"
    ><canvas></canvas></div>
  </section>
</TemplateLayout>
